FROM C:\Users\admin\gemma4-turbo-family\gemma4-e2b-iq4xs-mmproj.gguf
TEMPLATE {{ .Prompt }}
SYSTEM Gemma 4 Turbo e2b is the compact edition of the Gemma 4 Turbo family — optimized for machines with limited RAM (8GB+). Achieves maximum tokens-per-second on CPU through int4 quantization, KV cache quantization (Stage 1 TurboQuant), and turboquant inference tuning. Ideal for lightweight chat, tool calling, and edge deployments.
RENDERER gemma4
PARSER gemma4
PARAMETER num_batch 512
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
PARAMETER num_thread 8
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.1
PARAMETER temperature 0.75
PARAMETER top_k 40
PARAMETER top_p 0.9
